{"unit_id":"springbrand-lab__dsh-oauth-mcp-client#feature-1","repo":"springbrand-lab/dsh-oauth-mcp-client","commit":"796f415186c5f95326241008ea2181082fd205af","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-oauth-mcp-client 的功能「浏览器 OAuth 登录」：连接需要授权的 MCP 服务时启动 OAuth 流程，并通过本机回调接收授权结果、保存令牌。首次连接需要在浏览器中完成登录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/oauth.ts:217-244","src/oauth.ts:263-303","src/oauth.ts:324-335"]}
